WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.767
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:02.834
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:03.634
We hope you're all
doing well tonight

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:04.501
and, now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:05.968
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.934
President Biden delivered
his second

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:09.467
state of the union
address tonight.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:13.400
Oh, you mean his balloon
assassination victory lap?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.367
[ As Biden ] You know who would
love some inflation?

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:17.968
That spy balloon, bitch.

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:19.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.167
But seriously, yeah, eggs are
really expensive right now.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:25.501
That's right, the state
of the union was tonight

00:00:25.501 --> 00:00:27.067
and U2's Bono attended

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.000
as a guest
of First Lady Dr. Jill Biden.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.534
And I got to say,
I love that she's using

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:34.200
the office of first lady
to tick off her bucket list.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.367
[ Laughter ]
I mean, she was at the Grammys.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:37.767
She's going to the Super Bowl.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:39.634
Now, she's hanging out
with Bono.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.834
[ Laughter ]
If Biden gets reelected,
she's going to get

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:44.234
the old gang together
for one last heist.

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:46.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:50.167
President Biden posted several
photos yesterday to Instagram.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.267
Not on purpose.
He was trying

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:54.601
[ Laughter ]
to answer his phone and kept
hitting the wrong button.

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:56.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.701
President Biden tweeted
a picture yesterday

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:00.934
of the first page of his state
of the union address

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:04.367
and I got to say, I'm surprised
how he's kicking things off.

00:01:04.367 --> 00:01:06.734
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:10.133
The Pentagon said yesterday that
the military failed to detect

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:12.734
three Chinese spy balloons
over the continental U.S.

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.901
during the Trump administration
due to a "awareness gap"

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.734
and because, after the eclipse,

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:20.067
Trump wasn't allowed to look
in the sky anymore.

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:22.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.901
The first public beach is set
to open this summer

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.734
in Manhattan,
along the Hudson River,

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.367
so, if you see
some beach bodies,

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.868
there's a good chance
they washed up there.

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:33.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:36.267
"Yellowstone" actor
Kevin Costner

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:38.267
is reportedly considering
leaving the series

00:01:38.267 --> 00:01:39.968
to focus on directing
a new film.

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:41.834
Said your dad, "But, you know,

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:42.934
other than that, I'm fine.

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.501
[ Laughter ]
Alright, here's your mom."

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:46.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.601
A dog in Nevada
was recently rescued

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:51.434
after living with a pack
of coyotes for several months.

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:53.767
Fortunately,
the dog is now safe, sound,

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.234
and embittered for life.

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.601
"I was living the dream!"

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:59.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:04.033
And, finally, the FAA yesterday
proposed fining United Airlines

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:07.300
more than $1 million
for skipping safety steps.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.100
Even worse, Spirit put
black electrical tape

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.534
over the check engine light.

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:13.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:14.467
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.801
We're off and running.

